   "widgets_values": [
    "## Installed SD 1.5 Checkpoints\n\n- `limitlessvision_v40.safetensors` *(Photorealistic SD 1.5)*\n- `savMIXSD15_v62.safetensors` *(Realistic/NSFW SD 1.5 Mix)*\n- `stablegram_v24.safetensors` *(FP32 Amateur/Instagram Realism SD 1.5)*\n\n**Why 2-Pass Hires.fix?**\nSD 1.5 generates best anatomy at `512x768` (or `768x512` / `512x512`) and then upscales `1.5x` (`768x1152`) with a `0.45` denoise pass for crisp high-resolution detail without twin-body artifacts."
